Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:08.92,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3180,3440)\pos(317.973,482.138)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:09.40,Thinking,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Stamp down Eastern Wu, we will take the south!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:25.70,Thinking,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Stamp down Eastern Wu, we will take the south!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:05:41.00,Thinking,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Stamp down Eastern Wu, we will take the south!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:06:01.88,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3660,3980)\pos(925.701,269.623)}Shī Xù
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:58.74,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.74,0:06:00.98,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,All the officials have taken their seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:03.28,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,May we start the performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:08.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Libationer Shi, is the pitch of the bells right for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:12.08,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,They have been recast and are ready to use!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:13.89,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:19.36,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,Begin the banquet and dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:51.66,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.41,0:08:17.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:49.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Ever since I raised my own army,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:54.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I have pacified brigands, eliminated warlords, and exterminated the wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:09:01.28,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I swore to sweep across the Four Seas, \Nto bring peace to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.28,0:09:06.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The only places yet taken\Nare those south of the Yangtze!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:11.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I now have a mighty host of one million!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:15.46,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}And with all your support on my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:21.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}why worry of Eastern Wu, or for our grand undertaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:25.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The day when we reclaim Jiangnan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:30.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}when the realm is without troubles,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:34.30,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}that is the day I shall enjoy riches and glory with you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Celebrate our great peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:40.60,Default,All,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}May we play the songs of triumph early!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:45.20,Default,All,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We will all rely on your grace for the rest of our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:10:10.49,Thinking,All,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}May we play the songs of triumph early!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.30,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.02,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let us drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:16.28,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:11:00.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I mock Zhou Yu and Lu Su's ignorance of divine will,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:04.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,that they even dare strike a rock with an egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:11.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am fortunate to gain deserters, for they will deal the fatal blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:14.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,This must be aid from the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.84,0:11:20.64,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2465,2780)\pos(294.456,490.819)}Xún Yōu \NStyled: Gōngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:24.94,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please speak carefully, lest secrets leak!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:31.18,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The seated officials and guards by me are my trusted confidants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:32.84,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What harm is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:41.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I mock Liu Bei and that Zhuge Liang more so!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:44.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,They think to move the solid Mount Tai with ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:47.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Is there anything more foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960.352,505.423)}Chéng Yù\NStyled: Zhòngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:13.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why are crows crying deep in the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:18.70,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,The moon is so bright that \Nthe crows think it is daytime,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:20.84,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,so they leave their nests and caw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.08,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Bring me my spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:48.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hand me wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.22,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With this spear,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:41.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I defeated the Yellow Scarves, captured Lü Bu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:44.75,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}destroyed Yuan Shu, defeated Yuan Shao,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:47.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}marched deep into the north straight to Liaodong,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:50.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and I swept away all obstacles across the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:55.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I lived up to the ambitions of a great man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:03.49,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}At this very moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.05,0:14:08.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}we have a bright moon in the sky above,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:14.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and tumbling waves of the river below.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:19.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With this scenery, I cannot help but feel moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:26.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I have composed a song and you will enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:29.40,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:53.31,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Short Song Style 《短歌行》\NBy Cáo Cāo
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:49.52,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,677.413)}To my wine I turned and sang,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:54.88,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909\pos(640,677.413)}how long can a man's life span?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:15:01.85,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Life alike a new dawn's dew; \Npast days many, futures few.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:13.50,Thinking,All,0,0,0,,Futures few!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:22.88,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}Banquets call for songs sublime,\Nyet I languor in decline
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:34.80,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}What can soothe this ache of mine, \Nonly can the God of Wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:43.88,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}Scholar's robe of nature's blue, \Nhow my heart still yearns for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:52.96,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}It is for that forlorn cause, \NI mused upon without pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:16:03.64,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}Bleats of wild deer echo there, \Non grasses where it's nourished
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.64,0:16:13.12,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}Honored guests gathered here, \Nlet the pipes and strings flourish!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:21.40,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Blazing bright doth shine the moon, might I ever grasp it soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:29.36,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}Sadness that dwells deep in me, \Nnever will it cease to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:32.92,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}Comrades crossing far and wide, \Nhonor me and join my side;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:36.24,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}with reunion as our fest, \Nreminiscing past times blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:38.96,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}Comrades crossing far and wide, \Nhonor me and join my side;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:46.80,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}with reunion as our fest, \Nreminiscing past times blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:56.04,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}Spare stars outshined by moon's light, \Nblack crows turn to south in flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:17:04.88,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}The crow flies in circles three, \Nno branch found on any tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:10.28,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Mountains do not spite the peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:15.08,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}oceans do not spite the deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:19.20,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Spat his meal did Duke of Zhou,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:19.20,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\an7}Note: When the Duke of Zhou met with sages, \Nhe spat out his food and rushed to welcome them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.24,0:17:43.40,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}led the world united, whole!
