Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:28.47,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k130}Yōu {\k92}cóng {\k102}zhōng {\k94}lái, {\k56}bù{\k44}kě {\k92}néng{\k81} duàn{\k59}jué
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:32.50,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k71}Yuè {\k24}mò {\k48}dù {\k41}qiān, {\k36}kuáng {\k45}yòng {\k40}xiàng {\k26}cún;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:35.91,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k84}qiè {\k21}kuò {\k44}tán {\k41}yàn, {\k39}xīn {\k44}niàn {\k41}jiù {\k19}ēn
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:38.86,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k35}Yuè {\k33}mò {\k48}dù {\k27}qiān, {\k38}kuáng {\k35}yòng {\k30}xiàng {\k37}cún;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:45.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k37}qiè {\k25}kuò {\k29}tán {\k37}yàn, {\k33}xīn {\k36}niàn {\k71}jiù {\k419}ēn
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:55.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k166}Yuè {\k74}míng {\k110}xīng {\k132}xī, {\k52}wū{\k141}què {\k35}nán {\k210}fēi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:17:04.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k154}rào {\k58}shù {\k117}sān {\k128}zā, {\k61}wú {\k92}zhī {\k52}kě {\k218}yī
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:08.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k99}Shān {\k26}bù{\k117}yàn {\k138}gāo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:14.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k30}shuǐ {\k50}bù{\k120}yàn {\k260}shēn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:19.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k139}zhōu{\k55}gōng {\k48}tǔ {\k258}bǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:40.75,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k45}tiān{\k413}xià {\k688}guī{\k817}xīn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:54.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Where is Shi Xu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:56.55,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.07,0:18:08.76,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,Chancellor, what are your orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:13.19,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Libationer Shi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:19.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You have always been strict about music.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:24.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,That was my Short Song Style. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:31.28,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The lyrics to your song are profound in meaning and they match the melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:34.02,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,Your literary talent is abundant and extraord-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:37.14,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Enough with the trite compliments!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Strike frankly at the errors!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:49.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let nothing restrain your words!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:52.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am always pleased to hear criticism!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:57.32,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,Sire, do you truly wish for me to speak the plain truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.21,0:18:59.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Naturally!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:04.50,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,The literary techniques of \Nyour lyrics are indeed insurmountable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.60,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,Only...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:08.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Only what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:14.82,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Court hymns should be poised and harmonious, pure and elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:18.30,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yet, there are ominous lines in the Short Song.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:26.60,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12.376}"Spare stars out-shined by moon's light," {\bord12.376}"black crows turn to south in flight."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.18,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The crow flies in circles three",
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.42,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"no branch to find on any tree."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:33.28,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Not only do these lines not align with court hymns,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:35.24,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}they are greatly inauspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:38.54,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We are about to invade the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:42.52,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If such inauspicious words are said before war,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:45.40,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}it will damage our morale!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You dare ruin my poetic mood!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:57.48,Default,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:30.70,Default,All,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:20.56,Thinking,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,"Cast it again!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:24.24,Thinking,Shi Xu,0,0,0,,"Cast it again!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.32,0:21:58.42,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yesterday, in my inebriation...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:00.74,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I murdered Shi Xu by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.75,0:22:05.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,My heart is weighed down with guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:09.48,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Shi Xu was the greatest musician of this age.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:15.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Now, there will be no more true hymns in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:22.19,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,But it is too late to regret!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:24.31,Default,Yu Jin,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:27.02,Default,Yu Jin,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.80,0:23:33.60,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,Ships of all sizes have been connected and secured by iron chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.60,0:23:35.70,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,The flags and weapons are all ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.70,0:23:37.30,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,Chancellor may inspect for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.84,0:23:41.70,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Go ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.70,0:23:43.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I will be there in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.26,0:23:43.87,Default,Mao Jie & Yu Jin,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:24:15.00,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Stamp down Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.49,0:24:24.58,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Chancellor, look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:35.20,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Chancellor, look there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.92,0:24:50.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(439.688,489.191)}Zhāng Liáo \NStyled: Wényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.44,0:24:50.48,Default,Zhang Liao,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.84,0:24:53.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(439.688,489.191)}Lǚ Qián \NStyled: Zǐkè
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.80,0:24:52.80,Default,Lü Qian,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.04,0:24:55.80,Default,General,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.17,0:25:10.70,Default,General,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:40.59,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Our Chancellor shall win!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.32,0:26:32.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2840,3240)\pos(928.815,496.726)}Zhōu Yú\NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:37.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If the heavens were not on my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.64,0:27:40.48,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}could Fledging Phoenix give me such a genius plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:43.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}See how the ships are chained up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.52,0:27:46.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}One can walk across the river
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.82,0:27:49.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}as they would on firm land!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:51.42,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.42,0:27:54.52,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}as the ships are joined, they are indeed rigid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.52,0:27:55.42,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.42,0:27:58.92,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}if Zhou Yu and his navy attack us with fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.92,0:28:01.78,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the ships will struggle to break apart in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.78,0:28:04.52,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor, this matter cannot be overlooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.53,0:28:12.17,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Zhongde, you look far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:14.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yet, you also see impossible scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.62,0:28:24.20,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Zhongde's words are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.20,0:28:26.40,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor, why are you laughing him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.83,0:28:30.77,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Come, bring me a torch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.77,0:28:31.44,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.18,0:28:35.77,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.00,0:28:41.62,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Zhongde, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.16,0:28:44.06,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Can you burn me with the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:51.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.68,0:28:56.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To attack with fire, {\bord12\pos(640,660)}one must rely on the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.52,0:28:59.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}It is the middle of winter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.56,0:29:03.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Only winds from the northwest blow;\N how could there winds from the southeast?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.44,0:29:07.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Our chained ships are on the northwestern bank, \Nand the enemy is on the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.92,0:29:13.70,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}If Zhou Yu uses fire, I ask you, would he burn my ships, or his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.49,0:29:16.79,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The flaw is obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.38,0:29:19.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,How could I not see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.24,0:29:29.42,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am not one who underestimates enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.08,0:29:32.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If it were a month ago or springtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.90,0:29:37.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,how could I not see your advice as logical, Zhongde?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:42.72,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,We can never reach your level of insight, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.16,0:29:44.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.50,0:29:47.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Furl the sails of the warships and return to camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.44,0:29:51.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Wait for dispatch, then prepare to fight Zhou Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.21,0:29:55.68,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Chancellor shall be victorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.05,0:30:00.54,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Do you remember how Shi Xu ended up last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.20,0:30:08.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sir, the vanguards have seen the \NWu navy beyond Sanjiangkou.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.82,0:30:10.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,They are about to engage our ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.28,0:30:19.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I would like to see how Zhou Yu \Nwill resist my chained ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.88,0:30:22.30,Default,Jiao Chu,0,0,0,,I am junior officer Jiao Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.30,0:30:23.08,Default,Zhang Nan,0,0,0,,I'm Zhang Nan!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.08,0:30:26.08,Default,Jiao Chu,0,0,0,,Although we hail from the very north, we can sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.08,0:30:28.10,Default,Jiao Chu,0,0,0,,Lend us twenty scouting boats tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.10,0:30:31.32,Default,Jiao Chu,0,0,0,,We can kill their generals and\N seize their flags for the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.72,0:30:34.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,You are all from the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.52,0:30:38.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,you are less adept in naval ability than the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.20,0:30:41.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Lives are at stake when two sides are fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.34,0:30:43.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Do not treat our warriors like toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.54,0:30:45.62,Default,Jiao Chu & Zhang Nan,0,0,0,,If we fail, punish us according to law!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.68,0:30:49.56,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,Chancellor, all the large ships have been chained!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:52.40,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,We only have small boats for twenty men remaining,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.40,0:30:54.72,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,which may not be suitable for this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.84,0:30:57.24,Default,Jiao Chu,0,0,0,,Where is the surprise if we win with large ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.24,0:31:00.95,Default,Jiao Chu,0,0,0,,With us two leading ten boats each, we will return in triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.84,0:31:04.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,In that case, we might as well give them the boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.44,0:31:08.10,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Dispatch another five hundred elite troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.10,0:31:10.08,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,arm them with more spears and crossbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.08,0:31:14.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Send the warships out on the river, we will pressure them from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.28,0:31:14.84,Default,Jiao Chu & Zhang Nan,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.28,0:31:17.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Wen Pin!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.12,0:31:19.60,Default,Wen Pin,0,0,0,,Present!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.32,0:31:22.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Lead thirty warships ahead to support them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.48,0:31:26.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I predict that the two might not win.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.52,0:31:29.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I intend to test the strength of the Wu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.32,0:31:34.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4060,4380)\pos(923.353,477.111)}Wén Pìn\NStyled: Zhòngyè
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.48,0:31:34.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If they fail, help them make their return immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.90,0:31:35.48,Default,Wen Pin,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.88,0:32:24.04,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Who is willing to fight and capture them?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.00,0:32:27.72,Default,Han Dang & Zhou Tai,0,0,0,,We will fight as vanguards and break up the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.16,0:32:29.06,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.32,0:32:31.68,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Everyone else will defend this camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.68,0:32:32.68,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.68,0:32:33.52,Default,Han Dang & Zhou Tai,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:43.04,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Look, Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.41,0:32:59.73,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Get closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.27,0:33:01.76,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.66,0:33:08.57,Default,Jiao Chu,0,0,0,,Loose arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.92,0:33:10.65,Default,Zhang Nan,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.70,0:33:17.80,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Throw darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.31,0:34:37.82,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Quickly pursue!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.56,0:34:45.68,Default,General,0,0,0,,Quickly retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.96,0:34:54.98,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Only by utilizing large ships chained together
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.98,0:34:56.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,can I resist the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.96,0:34:57.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Mao Jie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.96,0:34:58.64,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:34:59.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Set out immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.92,0:35:00.72,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.01,0:35:18.60,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,All navies should keep a lookout and stay on guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.60,0:35:19.28,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.72,0:35:26.96,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Cao forces lost the battle decisively.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.56,0:35:30.36,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu came out of the camp to challenge them again,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.36,0:35:35.88,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,luring the Cao army's chained ships out to face them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.81,0:35:38.63,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Quick, charge ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.72,0:35:42.63,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Shoot now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.07,0:35:49.22,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.97,0:36:22.60,Default,Zhou Tai,0,0,0,,Throw darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.66,0:36:43.88,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,General Zhou!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.92,0:36:47.00,Default,Zhou Tai,0,0,0,,General Han!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.53,0:37:06.14,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.76,0:37:08.60,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Strike the bell of retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.92,0:37:16.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3520,3760)\pos(326.727,461.277)}Hán Dāng \NStyled: Yìgōng
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.72,0:37:21.06,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Row, hurry and row!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.46,0:37:26.14,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Row quickly, row back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.08,0:37:32.08,Default,General,0,0,0,,Go after them and shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.06,0:37:36.72,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.28,0:37:41.94,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.96,0:37:48.76,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.40,0:37:52.60,Default,General,0,0,0,,Catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.00,0:37:55.56,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Row quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.77,0:37:58.65,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.75,0:38:13.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.64,0:38:20.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,This victory proves that the force of \Nthe chained large ships is boundless.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.68,0:38:27.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Mao Jie, strike the bell for retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.82,0:38:29.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu will not ambush us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.20,0:38:29.56,Default,Mao Jie,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.36,0:38:50.74,Default,Han Dang & Zhou Tai,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, we were defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.74,0:38:52.28,Default,Han Dang & Zhou Tai,0,0,0,,We accept any punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.10,0:38:54.96,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Generals, please stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.72,0:38:58.90,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Victory and defeat are but common in warfare,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.90,0:38:59.98,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.66,0:39:05.31,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Please stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.72,0:39:11.72,Default,Han Dang & Zhou Tai,0,0,0,,Thank you Commander for not executing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:22.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4180,4520)\pos(307.792,473.201)}Lǔ Sù \NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.38,0:39:29.72,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Sire, you are strict with military law.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.40,0:39:34.60,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Han Dang and Zhou Tai came back in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.60,0:39:36.21,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Why did you not punish them?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.39,0:39:43.84,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,I needed there to be a victory and a loss in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.44,0:39:47.01,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,What "victory and loss"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.36,0:39:56.77,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When Cao Cao sent out small boats to fight, I had to defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.77,0:40:01.13,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If not, I cannot prove my advantage in naval battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.13,0:40:07.11,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When Cao Cao dispatched his large chained ships, I had to lose to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.11,0:40:14.20,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Otherwise, I could not convince Cao Cao to believe in Pang Shiyuan's plan of chaining the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.56,0:40:35.76,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, when the wind blew earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.76,0:40:38.08,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,the gust snapped Cao naval camp's main banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.72,0:40:47.48,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,An ill omen for the northern army!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.12,0:40:50.34,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Zijing, come with me to the riverside to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.34,0:40:51.24,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.40,0:41:21.50,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,Cao Cao truly has an intimidating battle formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.50,0:41:24.12,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,yet he is still kept in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.04,0:41:29.38,Default,Zhou Yu,0,0,0,,He will not expect failure awaiting him in a few days!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.49,0:42:17.44,Default,All,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.44,0:42:21.16,Default,Lu Su,0,0,0,,Quick, carry him back to the tent, hurry!
Comment: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:34.80,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Du Kang was the legendary inventor of wine. His name is often used as a synoym for wine.

